      "message": "This padding doesn\u0027t seem right. There should be a single padding amount for the glyph. A transformed glyph has a padding of 1, a direct glyph has a padding of 0, and an SDFT glyph has a padding of 2. So, this should be abs(b.top - a.bottom) \u003e\u003d max(a.padding, b.padding).",
