      "writtenOn": "2022-05-11T14:31:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In my change I have padding (1, 1, 0, 0) for transformed and direct and (2,2,2,2) for SDFT.\nFor the old case it\u0027s (0,0,0,0), (1,1,1,1) and (2,2,2,2),\nIn either case the distance between 2 glyphs must be the sum of padding (bottom+top or right+left), or bigger if these glyphs are not placed exactly side to side.\nYou suggestion is a little more relaxed in case SDFT glyph + non-SDFT glyph.\nYou will check for distance \u003e\u003d 2. In reality it should be distance \u003e\u003d 3 (2 + 1). \nOr non-SDFT glyph + SDFT glyph: distance \u003e\u003d 2 (0 + 2). It\u0027s not symmetrical with my change.",
