      "writtenOn": "2022-05-11T18:34:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Until this moment it was my understanding that fSupportBilerpFromGlyphAtlas required 1 pixel padding in Direct case, too (it\u0027s in the code in the main branch).\nThere is a comment:\n // Force direct masks (glyph with no padding) to have padding.\nIs it not true?",
      "parentUuid": "4d63ce12_169ec6f0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 432,
        "startChar": 64,
        "endLine": 432,
        "endChar": 98
